# Canlı kasa = restroid-perakende

Kasa / Öde / Mobil POS / masa / PLU → **`C:\nextjs-projects\restroid-perakende`**.  
Köprü (GMP3, TSM, yazıcı) → **`restroid-bridge`**.  
